================================================================================
Scope and third-party content
================================================================================

The MIT license above covers the source code of this project — the HTML,
CSS, JavaScript, shell scripts, and configuration files authored for Desk
Quotes.

The following bundled content is NOT covered by the MIT license and retains
its original licensing terms:

  * assets/photos/        Portrait photographs sourced primarily from
                          Wikimedia Commons. Per-image license, author, and
                          source links are documented in
                          assets/photos/CREDITS.md. Reusers must consult
                          that file and honor the terms of each individual
                          image (attribution, share-alike, etc.).

  * assets/fonts/         Font files redistributed under their original
                          open-font licenses (see the upstream font
                          project for terms).

  * quotes.json           Quotations are attributed to their original
                          authors. The selection and curation of the
                          collection is the author's editorial work; the
                          quoted text itself remains the intellectual
                          property of (or in the public domain through)
                          its original source.

If you fork this project and substitute your own assets, the MIT license
above is sufficient for the code. If you redistribute the bundled assets,
you are responsible for complying with their respective licenses.
